{"family":"objects","record":{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:ba37e2825e4e3c758a5cfaec:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:ba37e2825e4e3c758a5cfaec:context:source-first-proposal","id":"urn:a-c:generation:ba37e2825e4e3c758a5cfaec:record:f7e872fdc86aa4b7d7df105dec5b4161","owner":"urn:a-c:generation:ba37e2825e4e3c758a5cfaec:actor:f-p-author","scope":["urn:a-c:generation:ba37e2825e4e3c758a5cfaec:scope:source-corpus"],"sort":"urn:a-c:generation:ba37e2825e4e3c758a5cfaec:sort:authored-concept","value":{"conditions":[],"definition":"The Product Definition schema’s stdoBinding separates repository transport, non-operative channel selector and exact installed release URI/manifest. URI and URI-reference formats require assertion-capable validation; schema shape alone does not resolve or adopt the actual Product basis.","exceptions":[],"grounding":[{"end_line":568,"path":"build_tenants/a_c/representation/stdo-v3.0.5-rc.1/source/standards/schemas/product-definition.schema.json","quote":"{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:stdo:schema:product-definition:3",
  "title": "STDO Product Definition Overlay",
  "description": "Layout-neutral exact STDO basis, identity, authority-location, bounded-context disambiguation, collective reference-frame basis, realization, work-carrier, bootstrap, and composition bindings for one STDO-defined product WHAT.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "$schema",
    "kind",
    "product",
    "constitution",
    "local_constitution",
